{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/569508-beast-the-primordial-kickstarter-please-someone-explain","id":569508,"title":"Beast: The Primordial Kickstarter. Please someone explain.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-26T13:09:48-07:00","id":569508,"title":"Beast: The Primordial Kickstarter. Please someone explain.","content":"I've had one serious doubt about one kickstarter step. Is this one: from 96,000 to 99,000 $.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beastly kickstarter</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">If we pass </span></span></span><b>$99,000</b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> of contributions, we will add another character to the </span></span></span><b>Beast Ready Made Characters</b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> project. But this one will be a member of one of our other supernatural groups like a vampire or a promethean and which game line we'll pull from is up to backers' vote. The </span></span></span><b>Beast Ready Made Characters</b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"> PDF will be sent to every backer who pledged for a Reward Tier that includes a PDF of </span></span></span><b>Beast: The Primordial</b><span style=\"color:#0F2105\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica Neue\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>Please explain the lenght and deep of that development. I mean, 3,000 $ is A LOT of money if we consider that the step is only creating ONE character (and if i have to be blunt, i find that kind of reward highly &quot;meh&quot;). So, i ask if we can have more detail about the work and depth of the character. Pretty please.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T13:31:11-07:00","id":569538,"title":"","content":"With all due respect, what frame of reference are you using for your idea that $3K is too much money for this Stretch Goal? I hope you are not working off the idea that the $3K is &quot;free money&quot;, as some people do. Most of that $3K is pledges which are tied to physical rewards, which means most of it goes towards creating the physical books and shipping them. We _choose_ to take whatever remains and use that to help pay for additional cool things that you, as a backer, then get for free and we get to put on sale to non-backers to help the game line grow. If this particular free extra thing doesn't float your boat, hopefully you'll be into the next one. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T06:36:24-07:00","id":570217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Phersus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/569508-beast-the-primordial-kickstarter-please-someone-explain#post569508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please explain the lenght and deep of that development. I mean, 3,000 $ is A LOT of money if we consider that the step is only creating ONE character (and if i have to be blunt, i find that kind of reward highly &quot;meh&quot;). So, i ask if we can have more detail about the work and depth of the character. Pretty please.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, you can't think of it as $3K for that one particular stretch goal, because that's not what happens. <br /> <br /> $3K, sure. But then you subtract the costs of manufacturing and shipping any physical rewards. And you factor in the cost of writing, development, and editing for that extra bit of text (it's not much, sure, but I sure don't work for free and neither do my writers). And costs for art. And Kickstarter's cut. And taxes. And anything else I'm forgetting. <br /> <br /> I've been on Rich's end of this, and it's a pain, because as a creator you're thinking &quot;this stretch goal is only gonna cost me $X to produce, so I only need to set the goal level for $X over target goal...&quot; NOPE. <br /> <br /> Trust Rich. This is not his first rodeo, he knows how to math his Kickstarters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T04:03:42-07:00","id":572501,"title":"","content":"Thank you for the answer and the politeness (and by the way, apologies if i came as harsh myself in my previous post, sometimes i'm somewhat vehement). Oh, trust me, I trust Rich, after all i've got my share of kickstarters on your (well, i should say &quot;our&quot;, as i benefit aswell from you releasing more products! xD) behalf. And yes, there are strecht goals that make this kickstarter worthwhile, like that incredible Dark Eras Chapter.<br /> <br /> But i've always found those Ready Made Characters heavily lacking in interest. I appreciate some characters and ideas (of course! i'm thinking for example in the Mogul, or Alice, or Frances, the Heiromagus) but i consider those a part of the original sourcebook, and when i compare that tier with others, like for example the ones in which short Beasts Stories are developed, or that Dark Eras Chapter i talked about... well, the difference between one character and those others is huge. Like real, real huge. It makes me think along the lines of &quot;oh well, i've got to pay for that in order to arrive to this other real awesome bonus!&quot;<br /> <br /> And that, from my point of view, is just a weak point in the development.<br /> <br /> I understand not everyone will think as i do; i understand there will be people more than happy with the ready made characters. If i recall correctly, there has been characters like these in a lot of kickstarters, and i've never complain about it... and supported the kickstarter nonetheless. But we are talking about one developed character here. Come on. One.<br /> <br /> That's my point. No more, no less.<br /> <br /> PS. One last thing: I was not thinking about the rewards as &quot;free money&quot;, by the way. I usually tend to not pay attention to economic benefits as result of your product development: that i leave to you, as is your business. I'm a fan, and as a fan, the only things that interest me is the material quality. Therefore i catalogue kickstarter tiers as &quot;AWESOME! - Cool - Nice - Meh - Wth&quot;. I'm not aware of shipping costs, or taxes, or art costs, and that's why i usually don't speak about them at all. I Just think about &quot;i like it, or not?&quot; and in that question comes the idea of &quot;is interesting/better/worse compared to what i receive from the other tiers?&quot;. And the answer to that question is what made me write my first post.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":1349,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","user":"Phersus","date":".  That PS 06-29-2015, 07:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}